  "notes": [
    "The PDF holds two forms: pages 1-2 are the FDP Form 10b Goods and Services bid-out for the Second Quarter CY 2020 (signatories on page 2: Cleofe A. Amores, BAC Secretariat; Atty. James Allan Sayson, BAC Chairman); pages 3-4 are FDP Form 10a Civil Works for 2nd Quarter CY 2020 (items 1-8 on page 3, items 9-11 on page 4, whose header reads \"FDP Form 10b\" but continues the civil works list). Civil works pages are signed by Cleofe A. Amores (BAC Secretariat Head) and Atty. James Allan Sayson (BAC Chairperson).",
    "Goods row 20-02-0269 has a bidding date of March 31, 2020, and civil works items 10-11 have bidding dates of July 07, 2020, outside Q2; transcribed as printed.",
    "civilWorks: the \"Name and Address Of Bidder\" column prints a contact person above the address; split into bidderContact and bidderAddress.",
    "bidderNormalized: a canonical spelling added by the transcriber so the same company ranks as one bidder across documents (case, punctuation and obvious misspellings unified, e.g. variants confirmed by the bidder name repeated in the address column or by an identical contact person/address). The printed name is kept unchanged in bidder."
